/*
organum

Two fragments, each a group ( ) inside one seq.
Hear it:    "mus/organum.mus" load   :fragments ->
*/

[fragments: !T:60 ( C4/8 b c b )  ( c b c d b ) ]

// every order of 2 to 5 notes, a group each (perms): di 2, tri 6, tetra 24, penta 120
[b c]       perms :di    R!! drop
[b c d]     perms :tri   R!! drop
[b c d e]   perms :tetra R!! drop
[b c d e f] perms :penta R!! drop

// hexa, the 720 orders of 6 notes, takes about 12 seconds to build:
// [b c d e f g] perms :hexa R!! drop
